      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapMethod of ItemStackUtil.getBookFromStack (priority 1500): an index of the loaded books' items (book order kept, getBookItem() called where Patchouli's loop would until every book is known) answers non-book stacks; MixinExtras @WrapOperation of the books.put call in BookRegistry.loadBook marks the index stale; helper bons.furious.patch.patchouli_books.PatchouliBooks; shadow mode -Dbons_and_furious.patchouliBookItemPrefilter.shadow=true",
